      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Okay, on a world uploaded with VRCSDK2-2020.04.01.10.20 on build 916, the setsynctype works as expected.\nHowever, on a world uploaded with the newer VRCSDK2-2020.04.03.13.11 on build 916, it throws errors when trying to use setsynctype in game. Also, in the unity editor, as per instructions provided for upgrading to this version of the sdk, doing so causes errors to be thrown when trying to select the different sync type options.",
